Spec: SpecDD Structure Model

Platform: IntelliJ Platform / Kotlin

Purpose:
  Extract SpecDD section entries from file text for structure view rendering.

Owns:
  SpecDDStructureModel.kt

Can modify:
  SpecDDStructureModel.kt

Can read:
  ../parser/*
  ../../../../../../test/kotlin/ai/specdd/idea/structure/SpecDDStructureModelBehaviorSpec.kt

Must:
  Use `SpecDDLineClassifier` to identify section header lines.
  Scan text line-by-line for LF, CR, and CRLF line endings.
  Return sections in file order.
  Store section label, trimmed inline value, label start offset, section start offset, and line end offset.
  Use `Label: value` as the display name when an inline value is present.
  Use `Label` as the display name when no inline value is present.
  Preserve duplicate and repeatable sections as independent entries.
  Ignore comments, blank lines, body lines, tasks, scenario steps, and key-value lines.

Must not:
  Validate section order, indentation, duplicates, or section content.
  Define IntelliJ tree elements.
